# GoatCounter (https://www.goatcounter.com) pageview counting — cookie-free,
# no localStorage, no personal data. Set this to the site's GoatCounter
# code (the subdomain part of https://<code>.goatcounter.com) to emit the
# counting script on production builds only.
#
# The production build on GitHub Pages gets this from the deploy workflow
# (.github/workflows/deploy.yml), already set to the live site's code
# (agistra-dev). Leave this unset for local builds to ship with no
# analytics script at all — the build still succeeds either way.
PUBLIC_GOATCOUNTER_CODE=
